Third-party components
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project depends on open-source libraries managed through Gradle. The full
set of transitive dependencies and their licenses can be listed with:

    ./gradlew :app:dependencies

Notable direct dependencies and their licenses:

- AndroidX libraries (Apache-2.0)
- Jetpack Compose (Apache-2.0)
- Dagger / Hilt (Apache-2.0)
- Retrofit and OkHttp (Apache-2.0)
- Kotlin and kotlinx.coroutines (Apache-2.0)
- FastAPI, Uvicorn, Starlette, Pydantic (MIT / BSD-3-Clause) — backend skeleton

